WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:02.190
- [Narrator] Tucked away in the depths

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.230
of Siberia is a the town of Mirny,

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.653
a cityscape dominated by a
massive hole in the ground.

00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:11.501
(electronic music)

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.780
This open pit was once
a thriving diamond mine.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.910
Mirny was one of the fist places diamonds

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.520
were found in Russia.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.500
The Mir mine is about 1,700 feet deep

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.470
and is one of the largest
mines in the world.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.580
While the mine is now closed, it stands

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.050
as a testament to the
small town's perseverance

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.363
against the harsh Siberian winters.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.810
Building the mine was a difficult task.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.560
It took seven years of
miners battling winters

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.253
for seven months out of the year.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.350
With temperatures hitting below freezing,

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.163
digging was nearly impossible
in the frozen ground.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.270
With this historic
landmark, the small town's

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.740
record-breaking mine
reminds its inhabitants

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.307
that they are still a
diamond in the rough.

00:01:03.123 --> 00:01:05.873
(digital effect)

